          }
        }
      },
      "content": {
        "kind": "freeform",
        "text": "This record describes a modern critical reconstruction of the Laws of Hammurapi, coordinating the monumental stela and tablet witnesses, the stela lacuna, later copies, variants, prologue, provisions, epilogue and editorial numbering. The reconstruction is neither the ancient original nor an individual physical artifact. The source record carries metadata only; its content and membership observations remain unreviewed."
      },
